## Stage 2 — PowerShell Execution

Encoded PowerShell activity was generated on WIN11-02.

```powershell
$cmd='Write-Output "Sprint32 CAP001 Purple Team Test"'
```

```powershell
$encoded=[Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::Unicode.GetBytes($cmd))
```

```powershell
powershell.exe -EncodedCommand $encoded
```

Expected output:

```text
Sprint32 CAP001 Purple Team Test
```

This activity exercised:

```text
DET-003 — Encoded PowerShell Execution
```

and:

```text
CORR-002 — Remote Network Logon Followed by PowerShell
```

