## Stage 3 — Scheduled Task Persistence

A controlled scheduled task was created on WIN11-02:

```cmd
schtasks /create /tn "CAP001-Test" /tr "cmd.exe /c echo CAP001 >> C:\Windows\Temp\CAP001.txt" /sc once /st 23:59 /f
```

This activity represented:

```text
DET-004 — Suspicious Scheduled Task Creation
```

Scheduled-task telemetry has demonstrated inconsistent historical availability within the lab and was documented accordingly where necessary.

