## Known Lab Limitations

1. Event IDs 4625 and 4698 have demonstrated inconsistent historical availability.
2. Several thresholds are lab-defined and would require tuning for production.
3. DET-006 identifies suspicious remote network authentication but does not independently prove SMB administrative-share access.
4. CORR-002 currently uses Event ID 4104 broadly at the correlation layer.
5. The host system has limited RAM and may not run every VM simultaneously at full performance.
6. The lab is intentionally isolated and does not depend on general Internet access.
7. SOC-OPS-001 evaluates telemetry received by Splunk and is not a complete endpoint sensor-health platform.
8. Some analytics are intentionally simplified for lab-scale implementation and education.

